        <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" Code="int correctionCount = 0;&#xA;&#xA;// Local copy of reconCurrency to avoid CS1628 error inside lambda/query&#xA;string reconCurrencyLocal = reconCurrency;&#xA;&#xA;foreach (DataRow row in dtHistoricalReconTransactionsReport.Rows)&#xA;{&#xA;    object creditObj = row[$&quot;Credit ({reconCurrencyLocal})&quot;];&#xA;    if (creditObj != DBNull.Value)&#xA;    {&#xA;        string creditStr = creditObj.ToString();&#xA;        if (decimal.TryParse(creditStr, out decimal creditAmount) &amp;&amp; creditAmount &lt; 0)&#xA;        {&#xA;            row[$&quot;Debit ({reconCurrencyLocal})&quot;] = Math.Abs(creditAmount);&#xA;            row[$&quot;Credit ({reconCurrencyLocal})&quot;] = 0.00m;&#xA;            correctionCount++;&#xA;        }&#xA;    }&#xA;}&#xA;&#xA;Console.WriteLine($&quot;✅ Corrected {correctionCount} negative credit rows.&quot;);&#xA;" DisplayName="negative Credit == Debit" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="416,197.33333333333334" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_51" Language="CSharp">
